flowchart TD
  Zip[golt-export.zip]
  Manifest[manifest.json]
  Metadata[metadata.json]
  Chunk[chunks/chunk-NNNNNN.bin]
  Codec{chunk.codec}
  Inflate[Inflate raw DEFLATE]
  Packed[Use stored packed bytes]
  Split[⠀Split payload into ⠀frame-sized ranges]
  Words[Read little-endian u32 words]
  Cells[Unpack numeric cell values]
  Tribes[Map values through metadata tribes]

  Zip --> Manifest
  Zip --> Metadata
  Zip --> Chunk
  Manifest -->|ordering, generations, codec, packing| Chunk
  Metadata -->|rows, columns, default packing, tribes| Split
  Chunk --> Codec
  Codec -- ⠀deflate-raw⠀ --> Inflate --> Split
  Codec -- raw-packed or stored-packed --> Packed --> Split
  Split --> Words --> Cells --> Tribes
